<h1>09_经济交易、资产配置与资源消耗 (Commerce, Finance, Allocation & Consumption)</h1>
<p style='color:#64748b;margin-bottom:14px;'>本领域共 <b>100</b> 个核心动词 • 右侧直接展示 <b>💬 口语 Phrasal Verb 短语替换 ↔ ⚖️ 通用同义词 ↔ 🏛️ 正式学术升级词</b></p>
<div class="sub-nav"><button class='ctrl-btn' onclick='toggleAllSections(true)'>📂 全部展开</button><button class='ctrl-btn secondary' onclick='toggleAllSections(false)'>📁 全部收起</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterRegister('all')">全部动词</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterRegister('phrasal')">🔄 仅看含 Phrasal Verb 替换</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterRegister('Formal')">🏛️ 仅看正式/学术语域</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterRegister('Vivid')">🎨 仅看生动/叙事动词</button><span style='color:#fcd34d;margin:0 4px;'>|</span><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_0')">01_购买、兜售、租赁、拍卖与贸易 (12)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_1')">02_投资、资助、补贴、征税与赔偿 (14)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_2')">03_获取、囤积、垄断、分配与捐赠 (53)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_3')">04_挥霍、耗尽、节俭与贪污挪用 (21)</a></div>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_购买、兜售、租赁、拍卖与贸易 (Purchasing, Leasing, Bartering & Trading)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 12 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='19%'>核心动词 & 语域层级</th><th width='12%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='19%'>中文释义</th><th width='18%'>英文精准定义</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='27%'>🔄 Phrasal Verb 替换 & 语域阶梯</th></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>merchandise<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>commercialiser<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to merchandise</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'mә:tʃәndaiz/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kɔmɛʁsjalize/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('merchandise', 'commercialiser')">🔊</button></td><td>v. 交易, 买卖</td><td class='def-en'>engage in the trade of</td><td>3.93</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>black market</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>trade</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“he is merchandising telephone sets”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>dispose<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>dispose<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to dispose</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/dis'pәuz/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/dispoz/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('dispose', 'dispose')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 处理, 排列, 布置；vi. 处置</td><td class='def-en'>give, sell, or transfer to another</td><td>3.53</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>cast aside</span><span class='pv-pill'>cast away</span><span class='pv-pill'>cast out</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>discard</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>fling</span><span class='nt-pill'>toss</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“She disposed of her parents' possessions”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>auctioneer<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>commissaire-priseur<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to auctioneer</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/.ɒ:kʃә'niә/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kɔmisɛʁpʁizœʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('auctioneer', 'commissaire-priseur')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 拍卖</td><td class='def-en'>sell at an auction</td><td>3.15</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>auction off</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>auction</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to auctioneer (sell at an auction).”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>repurchase<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>racheter<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to repurchase</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ri:'pә:tʃәs/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʁaʃte/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('repurchase', 'racheter')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 再买, 买回</td><td class='def-en'>buy what had previously been sold, lost, or given away</td><td>2.94</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>buy back</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“He bought back the house that his father sold years ago”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='0'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>export<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>exportation<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to export</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ik'spɒ:t/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɛkspɔʁtasjɔ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('export', 'exportation')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 输出, 出口；vi. 输出物资</td><td class='def-en'>sell or transfer abroad</td><td>4.24</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div class='ex-line'>“we export less than we import and have a negative trade balance”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='0'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>wholesale<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>wholesale<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to wholesale</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'hәulseil/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/wholesale/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('wholesale', 'wholesale')">🔊</button></td><td>vi. 经营批发业, 批发；vt. 批发</td><td class='def-en'>sell in large quantities</td><td>3.97</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to wholesale (sell in large quantities).”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='0'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>prostitute<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>prostituée<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to prostitute</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'prɒstitju:t/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/pʁɔstitɥe/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('prostitute', 'prostituée')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 使沦为妓女</td><td class='def-en'>sell one's body; exchange sex for money</td><td>3.58</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to prostitute (sell one's body).”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Vivid' data-pv='0'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>scalp<span class='reg-Vivid'>🎨 生动/叙事</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>cuir chevelu<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 2e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to scalp</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/skælp/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kɥiʁ ʃəvly/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('scalp', 'cuir chevelu')">🔊</button></td><td>v. 剥头皮</td><td class='def-en'>sell illegally, as on the black market</td><td>3.48</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to scalp (sell illegally, as on the black market).”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='0'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>smuggle<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>passer en contrebande<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to smuggle</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'smʌgl/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/pase ɑ̃ kɔ̃tʁəbɑ̃d/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('smuggle', 'passer en contrebande')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 偷运, 走私, 私运；vi. 走私</td><td class='def-en'>import or export without paying customs duties</td><td>3.11</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div class='ex-line'>“She smuggled cigarettes across the border”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='0'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>bootleg<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>bootleg<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to bootleg</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'bu:tleg/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/bootleg/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('bootleg', 'bootleg')">🔊</button></td><td>v. 私卖(酒)</td><td class='def-en'>sell illicit products such as drugs or alcohol</td><td>3.07</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div class='ex-line'>“They were bootlegging whiskey”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Vivid' data-pv='0'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>resell<span class='reg-Vivid'>🎨 生动/叙事</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>revendre<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to resell</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ri:'sel/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʁəvɑ̃dʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('resell', 'revendre')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 再卖, 转售</td><td class='def-en'>sell (something) again after having bought it</td><td>2.93</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to resell (sell (something) again after having bought it).”</div></div></td></tr>
