<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02_投资、资助、补贴、征税与赔偿 (Investing, Subsidizing, Taxing & Compensating)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 14 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='19%'>核心动词 & 语域层级</th><th width='12%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='19%'>中文释义</th><th width='18%'>英文精准定义</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='27%'>🔄 Phrasal Verb 替换 & 语域阶梯</th></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>afford<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>être en mesure de<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to afford</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ә'fɒ:d/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɛtʁ ɑ̃ məzyʁ də/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('afford', 'être en mesure de')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 买得起, 足以, 给予</td><td class='def-en'>be able to spare or give up</td><td>4.57</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>back down</span><span class='pv-pill'>give in</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>yield</span><span class='nt-pill'>give</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“I can't afford to spend two hours with this person”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>invest<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>injecter<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to invest</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/in'vest/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɛ̃ʒɛkte/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('invest', 'injecter')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 投资, 花费, 笼罩, 授予；vi. 投资, 利用</td><td class='def-en'>make an investment</td><td>4.32</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>buy into</span><span class='pv-pill'>roll over</span><span class='pv-pill'>tie up</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>empower</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>put</span><span class='nt-pill'>commit</span><span class='nt-pill'>place</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“Put money into bonds”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>owe<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>devoir<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to owe</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/әu/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/dəvwaʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('owe', 'devoir')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 亏欠, 负...债, 归功于, 怀有, 应给予, 感恩；vi. 欠钱</td><td class='def-en'>be obliged to pay or repay</td><td>4.13</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>chalk up</span><span class='pv-pill'>run up</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to owe (be obliged to pay or repay).”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Vivid' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>repay<span class='reg-Vivid'>🎨 生动/叙事</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>rembourser<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to repay</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ri'pei/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʁɑ̃buʁse/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('repay', 'rembourser')">🔊</button></td><td>v. 偿还, 报答, 报复</td><td class='def-en'>pay back</td><td>3.66</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>give back</span><span class='pv-pill'>pay back</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>requite</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>refund</span><span class='nt-pill'>return</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“Please refund me my money”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Vivid' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>bribe<span class='reg-Vivid'>🎨 生动/叙事</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>bribe<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to bribe</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/braib/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/bribe/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('bribe', 'bribe')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 贿赂, 收买；vi. 行贿</td><td class='def-en'>make illegal payments to in exchange for favors or influence</td><td>3.5</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>buy off</span><span class='pv-pill'>grease one's palms</span><span class='pv-pill'>pay off</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>corrupt</span><span class='nt-pill'>buy</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“This judge can be bought”</div></div></td></tr>
