<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>remit<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>remit<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to remit</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ri'mit/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʁəmi/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('remit', 'remit')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 宽恕, 赦免, 免除, 汇出, 缓解, 减轻, 把...提交, 使恢复原状, 推迟；vi. 缓解, 汇款</td><td class='def-en'>send (money) in payment</td><td>3.09</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>hold over</span><span class='pv-pill'>put off</span><span class='pv-pill'>put over</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>postpone</span><span class='fm-pill'>prorogue</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>table</span><span class='nt-pill'>shelve</span><span class='nt-pill'>defer</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“remit $25”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>reimburse<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>compenser<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to reimburse</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/.ri:im'bә:s/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kɔ̃pɑ̃se/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('reimburse', 'compenser')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 付还, 偿还, 赔偿</td><td class='def-en'>pay back for some expense incurred</td><td>3.06</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>give back</span><span class='pv-pill'>pay back</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>recoup</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“Can the company reimburse me for my professional travel?”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Vivid' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>recoup<span class='reg-Vivid'>🎨 生动/叙事</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>reprendre<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to recoup</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ri'ku:p/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʁəpʁɑ̃dʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('recoup', 'reprendre')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 偿还, 赔偿, 补偿, 扣除；vi. 补偿损失</td><td class='def-en'>reimburse or compensate (someone), as for a loss</td><td>2.98</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>pay back</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>reimburse</span><span class='fm-pill'>recuperate</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>recover</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to recoup (reimburse or compensate (someone), as for a loss).”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>subsidize<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>subventionner<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to subsidize</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'sʌbsidaiz/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/sybvɑ̃sjɔne/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('subsidize', 'subventionner')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 补助, 资助, 贿赂</td><td class='def-en'>support through subsidies</td><td>2.93</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>back up</span><span class='pv-pill'>stand by</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>subsidise</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“The arts in Europe are heavily subsidized”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Vivid' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>wanton<span class='reg-Vivid'>🎨 生动/叙事</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>wanton<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to wanton</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'wɒntәn/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/wanton/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('wanton', 'wanton')">🔊</button></td><td>vi. 变化无常, 嬉戏, 闲荡, 放肆；vt. 挥霍</td><td class='def-en'>waste time; spend one's time idly or inefficiently</td><td>2.86</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>piddle away</span><span class='pv-pill'>wanton away</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>piddle</span><span class='nt-pill'>trifle</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to wanton (waste time).”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>deplete<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>arroser<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to deplete</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/di'pli:t/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/aʁoze/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('deplete', 'arroser')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 耗尽, 使衰竭</td><td class='def-en'>use up (resources or materials)</td><td>2.65</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>burn off</span><span class='pv-pill'>burn up</span><span class='pv-pill'>eat up</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>consume</span><span class='nt-pill'>eat</span><span class='nt-pill'>exhaust</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“this car consumes a lot of gas”</div></div></td></tr>
