<details class='sub-section' id='sub_3'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>04_挥霍、耗尽、节俭与贪污挪用 (Squandering, Depleting, Economizing & Embezzling)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 21 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='19%'>核心动词 & 语域层级</th><th width='12%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='19%'>中文释义</th><th width='18%'>英文精准定义</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='27%'>🔄 Phrasal Verb 替换 & 语域阶梯</th></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>steal<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>voler<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to steal</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/sti:l/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/vɔle/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('steal', 'voler')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 剽窃；偷偷地做；偷窃；vi. 窃取；偷偷地行动；[棒球]偷垒；n. [口]偷窃；便宜货；偷垒；[篮球]断球</td><td class='def-en'>take without the owner's consent</td><td>4.41</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>knock off</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>slip</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“Someone stole my wallet on the train”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>cop<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>hameçon<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to cop</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/kɒp/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/amsɔ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('cop', 'hameçon')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 抓住</td><td class='def-en'>take by theft</td><td>4.37</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>knock off</span><span class='pv-pill'>pick up</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>apprehend</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>hook</span><span class='nt-pill'>snitch</span><span class='nt-pill'>thieve</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“Someone snitched my wallet!”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>rob<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>cambrioler<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to rob</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/rɒb/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kɑ̃bʁijɔle/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('rob', 'cambrioler')">🔊</button></td><td>v. 抢夺, 抢掠, 剥夺</td><td class='def-en'>take something away by force or without the consent of the owner</td><td>4.35</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>hold up</span><span class='pv-pill'>stick up</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>overcharge</span><span class='fm-pill'>surcharge</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>soak</span><span class='nt-pill'>gazump</span><span class='nt-pill'>fleece</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“The burglars robbed him of all his money”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>consume<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>consommer<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to consume</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/kәn'sju:m/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kɔ̃sɔme/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('consume', 'consommer')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 消耗, 消费, 消灭；vi. 耗尽, 毁灭</td><td class='def-en'>eat immoderately</td><td>3.88</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>eat up</span><span class='pv-pill'>go through</span><span class='pv-pill'>take in</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>devour</span><span class='nt-pill'>down</span><span class='nt-pill'>ingest</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“Some people can down a pound of meat in the course of one meal”</div></div></td></tr>
